Z||000000||Gonzo_442||08-20-2001||06:08 PM||||One of my clients walked into my office today and handed me an issue of MotorTrend Magazine. September 1983. Seems he had seen my PFF calendar hanging on the wall next to my desk on a previous visit.<P>Just thought it was interesting to get a chance to read through what they had to say about the first Fieros. (Cover shot, and 11 pages, including a centerfold)<P>Some interesting concept shots too. Some of them look like the design was borrowed for some kits i've seen.||||reg||10
Z||000001||FieroLisa||08-20-2001||09:20 PM||||today in my streak of boredom, i re-read all my 80's Fiero articles... it's kinda of fun, yet insulting cause most of them weren;t the most complimentary but oh well.  The one I read today had the red coupe on the cover...can't remember which magazine it was and in too much pain to walk over and find out.||||reg||1
Z||000002||kslish||08-21-2001||01:26 AM||||Hmmm...red coupe on the cover....sounds like Road & Track, Sept. 1983.<P>The Sept. 1983 Motor Trend had a white Fiero on the cover right?  <P>I've just started compiling my 30+ Fiero magazines...just so I can see what I have duplicates of and so I know what I have.  <P>I've scanned and OCR'd some of the articles at the following address:<BR> <A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/wpfc/PFmuseum.html" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nbci.com/wpfc/PFmuseum.html</A> <P><P>------------------<BR>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR>See them at <A HREF="http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html</A><BR>Western PA Fiero Club - <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Galen||08-21-2001||01:33 AM||||Car and driver Sept. 1983 has a Red Fiero poking its nose out at the top of the cover  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I got Sept 83(mentioned above) and Jan 84... with a article on the fiero(a small one) anyone want em? Make an offer?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/sig.gif">  Ray -    <A HREF="mailto:galen@ezrpg.com">galen@ezrpg.com</A>    - <A HREF="http://www.fierolinks.f2s.com/" TARGET=_blank>www.FieroLinks.f2s.com</A><BR>AIM: GalenRPG - ICQ: 98668558||||reg||1
